# Line endings: everything text-like is stored as LF in the repository and
# checked out as LF on every OS. This keeps `pnpm verify` (Biome with
# `lineEnding: "lf"`) green on Windows and Linux regardless of each machine's
# `core.autocrlf`. See docs/extractor/DECISIONS.md (ADR-023).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
